# mesh-identity

Private identity repo for the mesh ecosystem. Contains personal configs,
secrets-adjacent placeholders, host-specific paths, and Claude memory.

Paired with [mesh-workstation](https://github.com/YOUR_USER/mesh-workstation)
which provides all universal tooling.

## Setup

```bash
git clone git@github.com:YOUR_USER/mesh-identity.git ~/mesh-identity
MESH_WORKSTATION_DIR=~/mesh-workstation bash ~/mesh-identity/install.sh
```

## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| `shell/` | Shell configs (aliases, completions, zshrc.local) |
| `git/` | Git identity (gitconfig.local, gitignore_global) |
| `ssh/` | SSH config + authorized_keys |
| `config/` | App configs (btop, eza, lazygit, nvim, htop) |
| `code-server/` | code-server settings + extensions |
| `.ai/memory/` | Claude persistent memory |
| `scripts/` | Per-host auto-update config |
